        docs: '```coffeescript [specscript]\n' +
          'type DynamoDBJSONObject = Object<\n' +
          '  [key string]: { S: string }\n' +
          '                |{ N: number }\n' +
          '                |{ B: Buffer }\n' +
          '                |{ L: Array<DynamoDBJSONObject> }\n' +
          '                |{ M: Object<DynamoDBJSONObject> }\n' +
          '>\n' +
          '\n' +
          'stream[Symbol.asyncIterator]() -> asyncIterator AsyncIterator<Record {\n' +
          '  eventID,\n' +
          "  eventName: 'INSERT'|'MODIFY'|'REMOVE',\n" +
          '  eventVersion: string,\n' +
          '  eventSource: string,\n' +
          '  awsRegion: string,\n' +
          '  dynamodb: {\n' +
          '    ApproximateCreationDateTime: Date,\n' +
          '    NewImage: DynamoDBJSONObject,\n' +
          '    SequenceNumber: string,\n' +
          '    SizeBytes: number,\n' +
          "    StreamViewType: 'NEW_AND_OLD_IMAGES'|'NEW_IMAGE'|'OLD_IMAGE'|'KEYS_ONLY',\n" +
          '  },\n' +
          '}>\n' +
          '```\n' +
          '\n' +
          'Implements the [async iterable protocol](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Iteration_protocols#the_async_iterator_and_async_iterable_protocols). Allows for consumption of the DynamoDB stream as an async iterable.\n' +
          '\n' +
          '```\n' +
          'const awsCreds = {\n' +
          "  accessKeyId: 'my-access-key-id',\n" +
          "  secretAccessKey: 'my-secret-access-key',\n" +
          "  region: 'my-region',\n" +
          '}\n' +
          '\n' +
          'const myTable = new DynamoTable({\n' +
          "  name: 'my-table'\n" +
          "  key: [{ id: 'string' }],\n" +
          '  ...awsCreds,\n' +
          '})\n' +
          'await myTable.ready\n' +
          '\n' +
          'cons myStream = new DynamoDBStream({\n' +
          "  table: 'my-table',\n" +
          '  ...awsCreds,\n' +
          '})\n' +
          'await myStream.ready\n' +
          '\n' +
          'for await (const record of myStream) {\n' +
          '  console.log(record)\n' +
          "  // { eventID: '...', eventName: '...', dynamodb: {...}, ... }\n" +
          "  // { eventID: '...', eventName: '...', dynamodb: {...}, ... }\n" +
          "  // { eventID: '...', eventName: '...', dynamodb: {...}, ... }\n" +
          '}\n' +
          '```\n' +
          '\n' +
          'Same DynamoDBStream instance [Symbol.asyncIterator] interface may be invoked to produce multiple streams of the same records\n' +
          '\n' +
          '```javascript\n' +
          ';(async () => {\n' +
          '  for await (const record of myStream) {\n' +
          '    console.log(record)\n' +
          "    // { eventID: '...', eventName: '...', dynamodb: {...}, ... }\n" +
          "    // { eventID: '...', eventName: '...', dynamodb: {...}, ... }\n" +
          "    // { eventID: '...', eventName: '...', dynamodb: {...}, ... }\n" +
          '  }\n' +
          '})()\n' +
          '\n' +
          '// records from above and below invokations are duplicated and streamed in parallel\n' +
          '\n' +
          ';(async () => {\n' +
          '  for await (const record of myStream) {\n' +
          '    console.log(record)\n' +
          "    // { eventID: '...', eventName: '...', dynamodb: {...}, ... }\n" +
          "    // { eventID: '...', eventName: '...', dynamodb: {...}, ... }\n" +
          "    // { eventID: '...', eventName: '...', dynamodb: {...}, ... }\n" +
          '  }\n' +
          '})()\n' +
          '```',
